 The **next candidate queue** is **deterministic**: same state input → same next ticket, no random draw.
 
+**Implementation:** `App\Actions\CallNextTicket` selects waiting tickets of the given queue ordered by higher `priority`, then oldest `issued_at`, then lowest `id`, under three call modes (`App\Enums\CallMode`):
+
+| Mode | Candidates | Fairness |
+| ---- | ---------- | -------- |
+| `any` | All waiting tickets, full ordering | Applied |
+| `priority_only` | Only priority tickets (`priority > 0`), full ordering | Ignored |
+| `normal_only` | Only normal tickets (`priority = 0`), oldest first | Ignored |
